# Rust build artifacts
mtgsim/target/
devgui/target/

# A failed picture comparison's outputs (egui_kittest); the committed PNG is the baseline
devgui/tests/snapshots/**/*.new.png
devgui/tests/snapshots/**/*.diff.png

# Local reference materials
MTG-Rules/

# NOTE: atomic-tests/ was ignored here until 2026-08-19, back when the plan was
# to keep only higher-level docs and treat the corpus as scratch reference.
# It is now the authored source of truth that plans/specdb.py derives from,
# so it is tracked. Only the derived database is ignored (see below).

# log files
*.log

# The dev GUI's boards, a folder each with its games' logs (`setup-architecture.md`
# §7b, decision 3): a person's work, which a sample becomes only by a reviewed copy.
devgui/boards/

# Determinism-check scratch. `engineering-practices.md` §3.1's three-run recipe
# writes these into mtgsim/; they are a diff's inputs, not artifacts.
mtgsim/run*.txt
# Derived spec database (rebuild with: python plans/specdb.py build)
spec.sqlite

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Scryfall census caches (plans/references/replacement-census.py) — derived, re-fetchable
plans/references/.census-*.json

# Derived audit worklists (`specdb.py audit --out`, `orphaned --out`) - a
# query's output, not a document. Regenerate it; never hand-edit or commit it.
plans/handoffs/cr-audit-worklist.md
